    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">curvātūra</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				bending, rounding, bend</i> (not ante-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Abstr., <i><span class="en">Vitr. 2, 8,
				11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 17, 14, § 72</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 19, 21, § 42
				al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Concr., <i>a vault</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">camerae,</span>”
				<i>an arched ceiling</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 7,
					3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rotae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the rim</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 108</span></i>
			.</div>
